rule WorkOrderLifecycle
	lineageTag: e8b6c6e4-f102-5f3f-ae94-0d85463437b6
	statement: A work order moves through Created, Acknowledged, InProgress, and Resolved. It is open until its latest lifecycle step is Resolved. Repair time (MTTR) runs from Created to Resolved.

	ruleReferencedEntity maintenance#MaintenanceEvent
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty action
		ruleReferencedProperty timestamp

	ruleReferencedEntity maintenance#WorkOrder

	ruleReferencedRelationship maintenance#EventOfWorkOrder
